T1  -  Oral adsorbents for preventing or delaying the progression of chronic kidney disease
JF  -  Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews
PY  -  2014
IS  -  10
PB  -  John Wiley & Sons, Ltd
SN  -  1465-1858
KW  -  Administration, Oral
KW  -  Adsorption
KW  -  Carbon [*administration & dosage, adverse effects]
KW  -  Disease Progression
KW  -  Humans
KW  -  Oxides [*administration & dosage, adverse effects]
